        "text_p8nWqn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you need reliable tape for the job, gaffers tape and duct tape are often the top contenders—but which one is the best fit for your needs?</p><p>Choosing the right tape goes beyond simply grabbing the nearest roll. Knowing the unique strengths of each tape can make all the difference—whether you’re sealing boxes for shipping, marking stage positions for a performance, or tackling a home improvement project.</p><p>At NADCO Tapes and Labels, we understand the critical role the right tape plays in your project’s success. In this post, we’ll explore both tapes in detail—from their adhesive properties to their wide-ranging applications—so you can confidently select the perfect tape for any task.</p>",
