          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Why It’s Essential",
            "content": "<p>Duct tape, renowned for its robust and versatile nature, is a cornerstone in both industrial and domestic applications. Its unique composition—a cloth backing coated with polyethylene resin and a rubber-based adhesive—equips it with durability and adaptability that meet a wide array of needs.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_y3PBe7": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Key Attributes",
            "content": "<p><strong>Reflective Finish:</strong> Duct tape’s shiny surface enhances its visibility and durability, which can be advantageous in environments where visibility and identification are key.</p><p><strong>Strong Adhesion:</strong> Its aggressive adhesive forms a powerful bond, though it may leave a residue that requires extra cleaning.</p><p><strong>Fabric Backing:</strong> The cloth backing provides flexibility and strength, allowing the tape to be torn by hand for quick applications – particularly useful for rapid, on-the-go repairs.</p><p><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:</strong> Duct tape’s affordability makes it a practical choice for large-scale projects or applications where budget constraints are a concern.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
