        "heading_xX8xCj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "Customization Options for Gaffers Tape and Duct Tape",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p>NADCO specializes in producing high-performance gaffers tape that can be customized to align with your branding, specifications, or project demands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_zByg7y": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Custom Gaffers Tape",
            "content": "<p>Gaffers tape can be tailored in several ways, depending on the demands of the project:<br/><strong><br/>Colors:</strong> Available in a range of colors, custom gaffers tape can be used to color-code cables, mark specific areas, or match a project’s visual needs.</p><p><strong>Printed Logos or Text:</strong> Printing logos, safety instructions, or other information directly onto the tape can be useful in event management or production environments.</p><p><strong>Adhesion Levels:</strong> Depending on the surface or how easily the tape needs to be removed, varying levels of adhesion can be selected to ensure the right balance between hold and residue-free removal.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_YyqBQn": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Custom Duct Tape",
            "content": "<p>Duct tape can also be customized to meet different application needs:</p><p><strong>Widths and Lengths:</strong> It can be ordered in various sizes, from narrow strips for more precise applications to wider rolls for larger tasks.</p><p><strong>Printed Designs:</strong> Custom designs, including logos or text, can be printed on the tape to enhance organization or for identification purposes.</p><p><strong>Specialized Adhesives:</strong> For more demanding environments, duct tape can be made with specific adhesives that offer added durability, heat resistance, or waterproofing.</p><p>These customization options provide the flexibility to tailor gaffers and duct tapes to the exact requirements of your project, whether it’s for organizing cables, marking areas, or handling specific environmental conditions.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_cnQ38J": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Ideal Uses",
            "content": "<p><strong>Entertainment and Production:</strong> Essential for marking positions, managing cables, and ensuring safety on stage and film sets.</p><p><strong>Event Management:</strong> Ideal for creating clear, visible markers and managing temporary setups without leaving behind any residue.</p><p><strong>Specialized Repairs:</strong> Excellent for bookbinding and repairing sensitive items due to its gentle adhesive.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
